<H3>EARTHWORM USERS EMAIL LIST SERVER</H3>

<P><b>To subscribe to this list:</B></P>
<ul>
<li>Go to the web page <A HREF="http://lyris.nmt.edu">http://lyris.nmt.edu</A>
<li>Click on "workgroups".
<li>Click on "earthw"
<li>Click on "Join earthw" and follow the instructions.
</ul>

<p> <b> Recovering your password if you are already a member</b>
<p>
If you are already on the earthworm mailing list, you have been assigned a random password.  
At the bottom of the page is an option to recover your password.</P>
<P>
<b>To send e-mail to the <TT>EARTHWORM</TT> list-server. </b>
<p>Address your mail to
<A HREF="mailto:earth@lyris.edu">earthw@lyris.nmt.edu</A>
<BR>

<p><b>Reviewing Email Sent to the Earthworm List-server</b>
<p>Enter the list server as described above and "Enter Mailing List earthw".</p>

<H3> EARTHWORM DEVELOPERS EMAIL LIST SERVER </H3>
<p>
<p> Any earthworm user is welcome to be included on the earthworm developers email list.  
<p> You can subscribe or unsubscribe by sending mail to:
<p>
<p><A HREF="mailto:ewdev-subscribe@gldlp.cr.usgs.gov">ewdev-subscribe@gldlp.cr.usgs.gov</A>
<p>                 or
<p> <A HREF="mailto:ewdev-unsubscribe@gldlp.cr.usgs.gov"> ewdev-unsubscribe@gldlp.cr.usgs.gov</A>
<p>
<p> The user will receive a confirmation request to make
 sure s/he controls the subscription address. Once this
 is verified the user is subscribed.
<p> 
<p> Un-Subscriptions work the same way.
<p>

